# No Cursor attribution

This rule applies in every session.

- Do not add `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with`, `Made with Cursor`, or any other git trailer.
- Do not pass `git commit --trailer`.
- Do not set a commit, pull request, or trailer author to Cursor's agent. Never write `cursoragent` or `cursoragent@cursor.com` in commits, pull requests, code, comments, docs, or chat.
- Commit messages are a subject and an optional body only.
